19367
ADDENDA <Act No. 19367, Apr. 18, 2023>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of Article 29-2 (2) shall enter into force 3 months after the date of the promulgation.
Article 2 (Validity period of subsidization for reinforcement of fire safety performance)
The amended provisions of Article 29-2 (2) shall be effective until December 31, 2025.
Article 3 (Applicability to report on results of implementation of reinforcement of fire safety performance)
The amended provisions of Article 28 (3) shall apply even to managers of buildings subject to reinforcement who fail to report the results of implementation of reinforcement of fire safety performance to a Special Self-Governing City Mayor, a Special Self-Governing Province Governor, or the head of a Si/Gun/Gu pursuant to the former provisions as at the time the amended provisions enter into force by December 31, 2022.
Article 4 (Applicability to subsidization for reinforcement of fire safety performance)
The amended provisions of Article 29-2 (2) shall apply even to managers of buildings subject to reinforcement who fail to report the results of implementation of reinforcement of fire safety performance to a Special Self-Governing City Mayor, a Special Self-Governing Province Governor, or the head of a Si/Gun/Gu pursuant to the former provisions as at the time the amended provisions enter into force by December 31, 2022.

